{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaZnyq2ktRUc3Ye2UMcW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is commit `070fa8b` (PR #743, ticket RESTWS-1037) in `openmrs-module-webservices.rest`, titled \"Fix PRIVILEGE_DENIED sentinel leaks into serialized lists, causing HTTP 500.\" The sentinel `ConversionUtil.PRIVILEGE_DENIED` was returned for a single denied object, but collections and maps kept it as an element. The serializer then tried to write it as a `java.lang.Object`, which produced the 500. The commit makes any denied element make the whole collection or map return the sentinel, and makes the bean-property path do the same. `BasePageableResult` skips denied items in paged results instead.\n\nI did not reproduce the visit-with-encounters request itself. The match rests on the commit message and the diff, which both describe this exact failure mode.\n\n**Lines that implement the fix (current `HEAD`):**\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java` lines 364-373: `getPropertyWithRepresentation` returns the sentinel when any collection element is denied.\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java` lines 397-406: the collection branch of `convertToRepresentation` does the same.\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java` lines 411-419: the map branch does the same.\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java` lines 431-434: the existing source of the sentinel, for a denied `BaseDelegatingResource`.\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/DelegatingResourceDescription.java` lines 248-256: a collection-valued property returns the sentinel when any element is denied.\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/BasePageableResult.java` lines 52-62: paged results skip denied items.\n\n**Related, not changed by the commit:**\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/BaseDelegatingConverter.java` lines 150-156 already skips sentinel-valued properties when building a delegate's representation.\n- `openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/test/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtilPrivilegeTest.java` is the regression test the commit adds.\n\nI included the code spans in the array because you asked for the lines directly. That goes beyond the \"change plus ticket only\" rule for why/when questions.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest\", \"commit\": \"070fa8bca3b59292118da26461b3d2cfd9a06796\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest\", \"pr\": 743},\n  {\"ticket\": \"RESTWS-1037\"},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java\", \"startLine\": 364, \"endLine\": 373},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java\", \"startLine\": 397, \"endLine\": 406},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java\", \"startLine\": 411, \"endLine\": 419},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java\", \"startLine\": 431, \"endLine\": 434},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/DelegatingResourceDescription.java\", \"startLine\": 248, \"endLine\": 256},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/BasePageableResult.java\", \"startLine\": 52, \"endLine\": 62},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/BaseDelegatingConverter.java\", \"startLine\": 150, \"endLine\": 156},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/test/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtilPrivilegeTest.java\", \"startLine\": 1, \"endLine\": 230}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2837,"cache_read_input_tokens":28339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2837},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05fd81e3-0a45-42a7-a263-ca8003e819f2","uuid":"f6db8b61-eec9-479a-ac9c-024c128029f5","timestamp":"2026-10-31T15:39:42.615Z","request_id":"req_011CgaZnyZfUWXWN4DimTVyS"}
